classDiagram
    class RecordIndex {
        <<viewer/src/data, index.json joins>>
        +adrToPullRequest map
        +epicToPullRequest map
        +sliceToEpic map
        +epicStatus map
        +contextVerifiesDistrict map
        +resolve() BundleModel
    }

    class BundleModel {
        <<viewer/src/data, resolved once>>
        +designs Design[]
        +pullRequests PullRequest[]
        +adrs string[]
        +diagrams string[]
    }

    class Design {
        +name string
        +stage string
        +epics Epic[]
        +lensesAvailable Lens[]
    }

    class Epic {
        +id string
        +slug string
        +branch string
        +state string
    }

    class Surface {
        <<enumeration>>
        WORK
        FLIGHTDECK
        REFERENCE
    }

    class Lens {
        <<enumeration>>
        INTENT
        PROBLEM_SOLUTION
        ARCHITECTURE
        RISKS_AND_VERDICT
        BUILD
        PULL_REQUESTS
    }

    class PullRequest {
        +number int
        +headBranch string
        +changedFiles string[]
        +design string
    }

    class OpenPullRequest {
        <<branded extension>>
        +status "open"
    }

    class MergePlan {
        +ancestorSha string
        +candidates CandidatePath[]
        +contentHash string
    }

    class CandidatePath {
        +order string[]
        +stopCount int
        +conflicts ConflictShape[]
        +replayed bool
        +failureReason string
    }

    class ConflictShape {
        <<enumeration>>
        GENERATED_FILE
        HOT_FILE
        IDENTICAL_CONTENT
    }

    class StateLine {
        <<ledger line kind, ADR-0019>>
        +kind "state"
        +subtype string
        +timestamp string
    }

    class MergeOrderProposal {
        <<state subtype>>
        +ancestorSha string
        +candidates CandidatePath[]
        +contentHash string
    }

    class Acceptance {
        <<state subtype>>
        +proposalHash string
        +chosenCandidate string
    }

    class PostMergeActual {
        <<state subtype>>
        +actualTreeHash string
    }

    RecordIndex --> BundleModel : resolves
    BundleModel "1" o-- "*" Design : lists
    BundleModel "1" o-- "*" PullRequest : lists
    Design "1" o-- "*" Epic : tracks
    Design --> Lens : lensesAvailable, disabled when no record
    Epic --> PullRequest : branch join
    PullRequest <|-- OpenPullRequest : branded extension
    Surface --> BundleModel : Work / FlightDeck / Reference each read
    Surface --> PullRequest : FlightDeck single-PR mode renders
    Surface --> MergePlan : FlightDeck multi-PR mode renders
    MergePlan "1" o-- "*" CandidatePath : ranks
    CandidatePath "1" o-- "*" ConflictShape : classifies
    StateLine <|-- MergeOrderProposal
    StateLine <|-- Acceptance
    StateLine <|-- PostMergeActual
    Acceptance --> MergeOrderProposal : references proposalHash
    PostMergeActual --> Acceptance : diffed against by auditor
    MergeOrderProposal --> MergePlan : mirrors committed data

    note for OpenPullRequest "PullRequest & { status: 'open' }, defined once in the<br>shared types module single-pull-request mode ships.<br>A field renamed on one type and not the other<br>fails the build instead of drifting silently (ADR-0027)."
    note for RecordIndex "Joins computed once by shared/build_index.py<br>into index.json, read (never recomputed) by<br>viewer/src/data, per ADR-0018."
